    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know if i even want to find my way back. if \"me\" is already gone, then what am i even saving? it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting a body that doesnt belong to me anymore. it would be so much more peaceful to just let the fog take over completely.",
